{"2929160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gremlin Party '03", "steam_appid": 2929160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gremlin Party '03 </strong>takes the platform fighter genre back to its roots. With fast-paced combo heavy gameplay, bizarre stages and a cast of characters that may or may not be dangerous to society, it's certainly an experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OK BUT WHAT IS IT REALLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a sizeable set of moves to slap their opponents around with. The higher their damage, the further they'll go flying when hit! To score a KO, send them hurtling off screen so they'll blow up, or something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929160/extras/8380d3d9b83ecac34c2056dd0a55a927.poster.avif?t=1786039211\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929160/extras/8380d3d9b83ecac34c2056dd0a55a927.webm?t=1786039211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929160/extras/8380d3d9b83ecac34c2056dd0a55a927.mp4?t=1786039211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of movement options to get around the stage, including some unique (at least we hope they are) mechanics  tied to the very much original<i> FUNKY BUTTON</i>. No, seriously!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929160/extras/565dabb677b4384fadc050bcd4d718ca.poster.avif?t=1786039211\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929160/extras/565dabb677b4384fadc050bcd4d718ca.webm?t=1786039211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929160/extras/565dabb677b4384fadc050bcd4d718ca.mp4?t=1786039211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FUNKY BUTTON??</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold LT (by default) to switch up your available options. Stuck on a platform getting tech chased? Hold FUNK and dodge roll to slip off the edge. Don't want to use your dash attack? Hold FUNK to throw out a light attack instead. Need to get around faster? Hold FUNK and tap down to slide. It has other uses too, letting you fine tune movement. Kind of.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MCKENNA</strong> - There's something seriously wrong with her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929160/extras/d222ff9945208bfa87b78dd8378a108b.poster.avif?t=1786039211\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929160/extras/d222ff9945208bfa87b78dd8378a108b.webm?t=1786039211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929160/extras/d222ff9945208bfa87b78dd8378a108b.mp4?t=1786039211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MISA</strong> - She has a badass crowbar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929160/extras/0bd1679c7ef159023eef73123087ebfa.poster.avif?t=1786039211\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929160/extras/0bd1679c7ef159023eef73123087ebfa.webm?t=1786039211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929160/extras/0bd1679c7ef159023eef73123087ebfa.mp4?t=1786039211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATURE</strong> - The benevolent (sometimes) space alien.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929160/extras/f1f25932925cc5e4b72ca13567829b55.poster.avif?t=1786039211\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929160/extras/f1f25932925cc5e4b72ca13567829b55.webm?t=1786039211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929160/extras/f1f25932925cc5e4b72ca13567829b55.mp4?t=1786039211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect many more fighters in the future!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gremlin Party '03 </strong>takes the platform fighter genre back to its roots. With fast-paced combo heavy gameplay, bizarre stages and a cast of characters that may or may not be dangerous to society, it's certainly an experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OK BUT WHAT IS IT REALLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a sizeable set of moves to slap their opponents around with. The higher their damage, the further they'll go flying when hit! To score a KO, send them hurtling off screen so they'll blow up, or something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929160/extras/8380d3d9b83ecac34c2056dd0a55a927.poster.avif?t=1786039211\